ecific task to complete. In the first level, the player must drive Benny the Cab to reach the Ink and Paint Club ahead of the Toon Patrol, jumping and swerving to avoid cars and puddles of Dip in the road. The second level is set within\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0120-2dd949c465b0:d01\", \"text\": \"Who Framed Roger Rabbit (1989 video game) Who Framed Roger Rabbit is an action-adventure video game created for the Nintendo Entertainment System by Rare and published by LJN in 1989. The single-player game is loosely based on the film of the same name and had combined elements of graphic adventure computer games with some more traditional action adventure gameplay. A different version of the game was also released for various computer systems in 1988. The game takes place in Los Angeles in 1947. The player controls private detective Eddie Valiant, who is always closely followed by Roger Rabbit. The game\"}], \"fallible_prior\": [\"Roger Rabbit\"], \"prior_explanation\": \"Roger Rabbit is the main character in the video game adaptation of the movie 'Who Framed Roger Rabbit.'\", \"fallible_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0120-2dd949c465b0:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0120-2dd949c465b0:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"main character\", \"scope\": \"video game \\\"Who Framed Roger Rabbit\\\"\", \"claim\": \"Roger Rabbit is the main character in the video game \\\"Who Framed Roger Rabbit\\\".\", \"answer\": \"Roger Rabbit\", \"quote\": \"The player controls Roger Rabbit through four levels, each with its own specific task to complete.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0120-2dd949c465b0:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0120-2dd949c465b0:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"main character\", \"scope\": \"video game \\\"Who Framed Roger Rabbit\\\"\", \"claim\": \"The main character in the video game \\\"Who Framed Roger Rabbit\\\" is Eddie Valiant.\", \"answer\": \"Eddie Valiant\", \"quote\": \"The player controls private detective Eddie Valiant, who is always closely followed by Roger Rabbit.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}]}"
